 \figcaption{Two venues I regularly visited in Edinburgh. [St. Mary's Episcopal Cathedral](https://www.cathedral.net/) for Evensong and the [Caley Picture House](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caley_Picture_House).}
}
\p{I really enjoyed my time in Edinburgh. Special thanks to Fr. [[obrw]] who always makes me feel so welcome in Edinburgh, and for introducing me to the [Caley Picture House](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caley_Picture_House), pictured above, a converted art-deco movie theatre that's now a pub. I later went back to have lunch with [[wadler]] before I left.}
